NCT03367078.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* patients with Disorder of Consciousness, VS (= LCF 2) or MCS (= LCF 3), due to sABI;
* any etiology, with the exception of extensive haemorrhagic lesions;
* stable clinical conditions.

Exclusion Criteria:

